1
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:07,554
The reports hold only what was collected, and only from the moment that

2
00:00:07,554 --> 00:00:09,307
collection was turned on.

3
00:00:09,307 --> 00:00:13,379
Open a chat profile, and open its Data Processing and Metrics tab.

4
00:00:13,831 --> 00:00:19,015
Enable session metrics collects the numbers, and adds thumbs up and thumbs down

5
00:00:19,015 --> 00:00:20,784
buttons to the answers.

6
00:00:20,784 --> 00:00:26,091
Enable AI resolution detection lets the AI judge if each chat solved the problem.

7
00:00:26,541 --> 00:00:32,075
Enable conversion metrics scores each chat against your goals, and Enable data extraction

8
00:00:32,075 --> 00:00:34,463
collects the details that you name.

9
00:00:34,463 --> 00:00:39,357
A chat counts as finished after its inactivity timeout, and the results appear

10
00:00:39,357 --> 00:00:40,871
a few minutes later.

